<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-GWA International yr net profit down.</title>
<headline>RTRS-GWA International yr net profit down.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    48.32 vs 47.31</p>
<p>    Net				     30.12 vs 31.52</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	     4.50 vs 4.00</p>
<p>NOTE: GWA International Ltd is a maker of bathroom and garden products and is about 40 percent owned by the Brisbane-based Anderson family.  </p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	     8.50 vs 7.50</p>
<p>    Sales				  331.45 vs 302.72</p>
<p>    Other income			   4.95 vs 3.33</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    14.4 vs 16.0</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			  nil vs nil</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 percent franked</p>
<p>Pay date October 1</p>
<p>Reg date September 13</p>
<p>    Tax				     18.20 vs 16.71</p>
<p>    Interest				13.73 vs 7.53</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  12.63 vs 10.72</p>
